gin:0 0 26px;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#2F4A46;\">We look forward to welcoming you on <strong>[FIRSTNIGHT:{%A %e %B %Y}]</strong> from 2:30 pm. Rooms are to be vacated on the day of departure, <strong>[LEAVINGDAY:{%A %e %B %Y}]</strong>, before 11:00 am.</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"arena-pad\" style=\"padding:0 44px 22px;\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background:#F4F6F0;border-radius:14px;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:22px 24px 8px;\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 6px;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#189979;\">Your stay</p><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #E3E9DF;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6F8A86;width:38%;vertical-align:top;\">Stay</td><td style=\"padding:11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #E3E9DF;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#14201C;vertical-align:top;\">[NUMNIGHT] night[IF &gt;:[NUMNIGHT]:1:s|]</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #E3E9DF;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6F8A86;width:38%;vertical-align:top;\">Room[IF &gt;:[NUMROOMS]:1:s|]</td><td style=\"padding:11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #E3E9DF;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#14201C;vertical-align:top;\">[IF :[NUMROOMS]:1:[ROOMNAME1]|[ROOMNAMES]]</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #E3E9DF;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6F8A86;width:38%;vertical-align:top;\">Guests</td><td style=\"padding:11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #E3E9DF;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#14201C;vertical-align:top;\">[NUMADULT] adult[IF &gt;:[NUMADULT]:1:s|][IF :[NUMCHILD]:1: and 1 child|][IF &gt;:[NUMCHILD]:1: and [NUMCHILD] children|]</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:11px 0;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6F8A86;width:38%;vertical-align:top;\">Expected arrival</td><td style=\"padding:11px 0;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#14201C;vertical-align:top;\">[IF :[GUESTARRIVALTIME]::not specified|[GUESTARRIVALTIME]]</td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:14px 24px 0;border-top:1px solid #E3E9DF;\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 6px;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#189979;\">Your stay in detail</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"arena-inv\" style=\"padding:0 24px 18px;\">[INVOICE:GRP_QTY_TOT_GRT_CUA€_LANEN]</td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td class=\"arena-pad\" style=\"padding:6px 44px 0;\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 6px;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#189979;\">Payment</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 20px;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#2F4A46;\">Payment is made at the hotel. Nothing has been charged to date: your card details have been stored as a guarantee only.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 6px;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#189979;\">Cancellation</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 30px;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#2F4A46;\">You may cancel or change your booking free of charge up to seven days before the arrival date, simply by replying to this message or calling us. After that, the full stay remains due. Our terms and conditions are available <a href=\"https://www.hotel-arenalerefuge.com/conditions-generales-de-vente-cgv/\" style=\"color:#189979;\">here</a>.</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"arena-pad\" style=\"padding:0 44px 0;border-top:1px solid #E3E9DF;\"><div style=\"height:30px;line-height:30px;font-size:0;\">&nbsp;</div><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-family:'Tenor Sans',Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:21px;line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:.02em;color:#14201C;\">Preparing your visit</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"arena-pad\" style=\"padding:4px 44px 22px;\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background:#F4F6F0;border-radius:14px;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:18px 22px;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;color:#2F4A46;\"><span style=\"font-family:'Tenor Sans',Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:17px;color:#14201C;\">Hôtel Arena Le Refuge</span><br>1425 route de la Restonica, 20250 Corte &nbsp;·&nbsp; <a href=\"https://maps.google.com/?cid=3308981832077220730\" style=\"color:#189979;\">Directions</a><br><a href=\"tel:+33495460913\" style=\"color:#14201C;text-decoration:none;\">+33 4 95 46 09 13</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp; <a href=\"mailto:contact@hotel-arenalerefuge.com\" style=\"color:#189979;\">contact@hotel-arenalerefuge.com</a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td class=\"arena-pad\" style=\"padding:0 44px 6px;\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#2F4A46;\"><span style=\"display:block;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#189979;margin:0 0 3px;\">Parking</span>The hotel has a free private car park right in front of the building.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#2F4A46;\"><span style=\"display:block;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#189979;margin:0 0 3px;\">Breakfast</span>Served from 7:30 to 10:30 am (€15 per adult, €10 per child). Any breakfasts indicated in your booking are for guidance only: we will confirm them with you on arrival.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#2F4A46;\"><span style=\"display:block;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#189979;margin:0 0 3px;\">Late arrival</span>If you expect to arrive after 9:00 pm, please let us know so that we can arrange your welcome.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#2F4A46;\"><span style=\"display:block;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#189979;margin:0 0 3px;\">Pets</span>Pets are welcome for a supplement of €10 per pet per night, to be indicated when booking or notified to us before your arrival.</p><p style=\"margin:14px 0 14px;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#2F4A46;\"><span style=\"display:block;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#189979;margin:0 0 3px;\">Around the hotel</span>From the natural pools of the Restonica and the Melo and Capitello lakes to the citadel of Corte and the villages of the Niolu, the valley is made for hiking as much as for wandering. Our ideas for walks and visits, in town and in the valley, are on <a href=\"https://www.hotel-arenalerefuge.com/que-faire-corte-restonica/\" style=\"color:#189979;\">this page</a>.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 28px;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#2F4A46;\">For restaurants, we are happy to advise you on site and book for you.</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"arena-pad\" style=\"padding:0 44px 38px;border-top:1px solid #E3E9DF;\"><div style=\"height:26px;line-height:26px;font-size:0;\">&nbsp;</div><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#2F4A46;\">We remain at your disposal for any special request and wish you, until then, a very pleasant day.</p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#2F4A46;\">We look forward to welcoming you to the Restonica valley,<br><em style=\"font-family:'Tenor Sans',Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-style:normal;color:#14201C;\">The team at Hôtel Arena Le Refuge</em></p></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:0 24px 20px;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;line-height:1.8;color:#8FA39B;\">SARL Le Refuge &nbsp;·&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.hotel-arenalerefuge.com/\" style=\"color:#436161;text-decoration:none;\">hotel-arenalerefuge.com</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.hotel-arenalerefuge.com/conditions-generales-de-vente-cgv/\" style=\"color:#436161;text-decoration:none;\">Terms and conditions</a></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:0;background:#14201C;line-height:0;\" bgcolor=\"#14201C\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/julesbuschi-ship-it/arenaos-releases@4a25c38/web/mail/pied-marbre.jpg\" width=\"600\" alt=\"Hôtel Arena Le Refuge – 1425 route de la Restonica, 20250 Corte\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:600px;height:auto;border:0;\"></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></div>"}